With this change:

• The page picker is now a small number input (“1 … ☐  0f 69 pages …” etc.)  
• The user can type any valid page up to `totalPages` without a massive dropdown.  
• If you’d prefer to use Carbon’s own `<NumberInput>` or `<TextInput type="number">` you can swap out the native `<input>` for one of those—just adjust the props accordingly.
